From 38b6a5db0d16562b132bbde4df4bbfcf4ee9e472 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 6 Aug 2026 03:52:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 06/21] Fix 1.6: stop pace math dividing by zero and crashing
 the formatters
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

PaceIntensity.paceSeconds(forRacePace:) divided by percentage/100 with no
guard. percentage is 0 on every step the current decoder builds (it
carries an explicit paceSecondsPerKm instead) and the Custom % editor let
the athlete type 0 directly. The infinity that produced reached
Int(_:)/UInt32(_:) in three places, all of which trap — a hard crash, not
