and creates the plan plus its scheduled workouts — but the stale error
makes the function return false and the UI says "Failed to subscribe. Try
again." They tap again and get a SECOND plan with a duplicate workout set,
which then has to be untangled by hand.

Reset at the top of the four entry points named above. Also gave that
function's DateFormatter the POSIX locale it was missing.
