Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

stopRecording() ends by setting showConfirmation = true. Calling it from
onDisappear meant trying to present a sheet from a view that is going
away. Split out tearDownRecording(), which stops the recorder and releases
the audio session without presenting anything and leaves the file on disk.
The interruption path still uses stopRecording() — there the athlete IS
present and should get the chance to save what was captured.
